<title>INDIA: Yield on India 14-day t-bill steady at 4.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on India 14-day t-bill steady at 4.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Thursday it maintained the cut-off rate of 99.81 rupees at its weekly auction of 14-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 4.96 percent.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 17 competitive bids for 20.19 billion rupees and accepted all.</p>
<p>It also received one non-competitive bid for 500 million rupees and accepted it.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom 91-22-265 9000</p>
